.TH LIBMPQ__WRITER_BEGIN 3 2026-08-18 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__writer_begin \- begin an MPQ streaming file writer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__writer_begin("
.BI "        mpq_archive_s  *" "archive,"
.BI "        const char     *" "name,"
.BI "        libmpq__off_t   " "size,"
.BI "        const mpq_file_options_s *" "options,"
.BI "        mpq_writer_s  **" "writer"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Begins a file whose final unpacked size is known. Supply bytes with
libmpq__writer_write(3), then call libmpq__writer_finish(3).
.PP
Add LIBMPQ_FILE_FLAG_SECTOR_CRC to options.flags to generate sector Adler-32
checksums for sectorized COMPRESS or IMPLODE files. Checksums cover packed
bytes before encryption. The checksum table follows the data and is not
encrypted; it uses zlib compression only when smaller than raw storage.
The flag is ignored for empty, raw, and single-unit files. Generation is
opt-in and does not enable implicit verification during extraction.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__archive_create (3),
.BR libmpq__writer_write (3),
.BR libmpq__writer_finish (3),
.BR libmpq__file_add (3),
.BR libmpq__file_add_path (3)
